  Note: "Important steps: \n1. Add, if not there, the [EYE] DataHandler prefab\n2.
    Add this to the list of dataclients\n3. Make sure that both \"EyeDataClientLslPusher\"
    and \"EyeOutlet\" use the same Eye\n4. Set the Sampling Rate on the \"Eye Outlet\"
    to the SR of your Eye Tracker (e.g., 120 Hz for the Vive Pro Eye) if the tracking
    is implemented accordingly; otherwise set it to the display refresh rate (e.g.,
    90 Hz)"
